# Python Library Management System

## Introduction
This project is a simple Library Management System developed using Python. It helps manage basic library operations such as adding books, displaying books, and searching for books.

## Objectives
- To understand the basics of Python programming.
- To learn how to use functions and lists.
- To develop a simple project using Python.
- To practice uploading and managing code on GitHub.

## Features
- Add new books to the library.
- Display the list of available books.
- Search for a particular book.
- Simple and user-friendly program.

## Technologies Used
- *Programming Language:* Python
- *Code Editor:* Spyder
- *Platform:* GitHub

